			"notes": "### MoneyRPC now works on 1.17\n- Ported the mod to support minecraft 1.17\n- Updated the endpoint link\n- Java version changed from 8 to 16\n\n### Installation\n\nDownload both the `money-rpc-1.2.jar` and `fabric-api-0.36.0+1.17.jar` (if you already have Fabric API skip this file ) and place theme into your mods folder. Start the game and brag to your friends how rich you are!\n\n### Galery\n\nMod menu listing:\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/58506649/123950970-8c801400-d9a4-11eb-9c8d-55e36f45b32f.png)\n\nDiscord Rich Presence:\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/58506649/123950989-930e8b80-d9a4-11eb-9587-126f1ffbca1d.png)"
